  },
  {
   "ply": 83,
   "t": 2983,
   "fen": "k4r2/3R4/PB6/1KP5/6p1/2P5/5P2/8 b - - 6 42",
   "line": [
    "Rd7"
   ],
   "spoken": "It occurs to me I can play a rook to d7, then d8, and trade the rooks.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 84,
   "t": 2990.5,
   "fen": "1k3r2/3R4/PB6/1KP5/6p1/2P5/5P2/8 w - - 7 43",
   "line": [
    "Kb8"
