   "t": 2992.5,
   "fen": "1k1R1r2/8/PB6/1KP5/6p1/2P5/5P2/8 b - - 8 43",
   "line": [
    "Rd8+"
   ],
   "spoken": "As long as the king is cornered that's good — but don't overdo it by stalemating unless you've calculated to mate.",
