   "fen": "1k6/8/PBP5/1K6/6p1/2P5/5P2/8 b - - 2 46",
   "line": [
    "Bb6"
   ],
   "spoken": "Let's move the bishop back to b6 — Black has a g-pawn, so no stalemate worry.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 93,
   "t": 3008.5,
   "fen": "2k5/P7/1BP5/1K6/6p1/2P5/5P2/8 b - - 0 47",
   "line": [
    "Kc8",
    "a7"
