   "line": [
    "g3",
    "a8=N"
   ],
   "spoken": "We promote to a knight — checkmate. A straightforward game, because Black blundered a piece in the opening.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 5,
   "t": 3021,
   "fen": "rnbqkb1r/ppp1pppp/5n2/1B1P4/8/8/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK1NR b KQkq - 2 3",
   "line": [],
   "spoken": "Even before that, Black misplayed it significantly.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 7,
   "t": 3026,
   "fen": "rn1qkb1r/pppbpppp/5n2/3P4/8/8/PPPPBPPP/RNBQK1NR b KQkq - 4 4",
   "line": [
