   "line": [
    "Nf3"
   ],
   "spoken": "Then typically a knight to f3, and to equalize Black must play c5 quickly to fight for the center.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 12,
   "t": 3042,
   "fen": "rn1qkb1r/pp1b1ppp/4p3/2pn4/3P4/5N2/PPP1BPPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 0 7",
   "line": [
    "c5"
   ],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "ply": 13,
   "t": 3045.5,
   "fen": "rn1qkb1r/pp1b1ppp/4p3/2pn4/2PP4/5N2/PP2BPPP/RNBQK2R b KQkq - 0 7",
   "line": [
    "c4"
   ],
   "spoken": "But I still like White's position.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 14,
   "t": 3047.5,
   "fen": "rn1qkb1r/pp1b1ppp/4pn2/2p5/2PP4/5N2/PP2BPPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 1 8",
   "line": [
