   "fen": "rn1qkb1r/pp1b1ppp/4pn2/2p5/2PP4/2N2N2/PP2BPPP/R1BQK2R b KQkq - 2 8",
   "line": [
    "Nc3"
   ],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "ply": 16,
   "t": 3052,
   "fen": "rn1qkb1r/pp1b1ppp/4pn2/8/2Pp4/2N2N2/PP2BPPP/R1BQK2R w KQkq - 0 9",
   "line": [
    "cxd4"
   ],
   "spoken": "After the captures, a queen recapture on d4 is nice.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 17,
   "t": 3054.5,
   "fen": "rn1qkb1r/pp1b1ppp/4pn2/8/2PQ4/2N2N2/PP2BPPP/R1B1K2R b KQkq - 0 9",
   "line": [
    "Qxd4"
