   "fen": "3rkb1r/pBp2ppp/4bn2/8/2P5/8/PP3PPP/RNBK3R w k - 1 13",
   "line": [
    "Rd8+"
   ],
   "spoken": "If you grab it, Black trades queens with a check on d8...",
